@ [canonical_specification_uuid] 221f8904-678c-4447-b51d-244273383b13

& [Problem] an obligation catalogue cannot be trustworthy if extraction confuses domain field names reference expansion shared definitions or reader direction
& [Rejected1] raw recursive key counts because domain properties become false schema keywords
& [Rejected2] fully expand every dollar ref because target rules multiply and cycles threaten bounded identity
& [Rejected3] globally deduplicate equal schema fragments because root and intended-use authority disappear
& [Rejected4] treat formats as assertions because the fixed I03D validator profile disables format validation
& [Rejected5] convert source-inferred typed differences directly into findings because no reader has executed
& [Rejected6] build cases while deriving obligations because target authority and solution choice would collapse
& [Selected] grammar-aware physical sites canonical definitions non-expanding reference edges direction-aware typed sites and non-executing root obligations
& [Reason] the selected form is a faithful compiled map of what future evidence must address while leaving observations and judgments to their proper stages
& [Disposition] is formation_justified_implementation_not_justified
